OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 3 Nov to Thu 12 Nov
OL,6,FNext week, high pressure is set to
OL,7,Fdominate the UK, bringing a lot of dry
OL,8,Fweather. Some places may start in fog,
OL,9,Fand this could be slow to clear, or
OL,10,Fpossibly linger all day. Elsewhere,
OL,11,Fcloud amounts will be variable, but
OL,12,Fthere should be plenty sunshine in
OL,13,Fmany places. For most, temperatures
OL,14,Flook to be fairly close to normal for
OL,15,Fthe time of year, though it will
OL,16,Fremain chilly through the day where
OL,17,Fany fog lingers and the sun fails to
OL,18,Fbreak through. Some overnight frost is
OL,19,Flikely where skies are clear and winds
OL,20,Fremain light. As we head into the
OL,21,Ffollowing week, there are signs that
OL,22,Fmore unsettled weather may return, but
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fconfidence surrounding this change is
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Flow.
